  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The enum `UnityEngine.Rendering.BlendMode` and `UnityEngine.Rendering.RenderQueue` cannot be used despite Udon providing access to `Material.SetInt` and `Material.renderQueue` where these enums make sense.\nAt the moment, making your own constants to these specific numbers is your best bet.\nThere is no safety issue as these are plain enums, therefore I propose to expose them.",
